desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Flutterwave Encryption Key"
	title_zh: "检测到Flutterwave Encryption Key",
	type: vuln
	level: low
	rule_id: "source-secrets-flutterwave-encryption-key"
	risk: "hardcoded-key"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
A gitleaks flutterwave-encryption-key was detected which attempts to identify hard-coded credentials. It is not recommended to store credentials in source-code, as this risks secrets being leaked and used by either an internal or external malicious adversary. It is recommended to use environment variables to securely provide credentials or retrieve credentials from a secure vault or HSM (Hardware Security Module).

### 风险类型
硬编码密钥（hardcoded-key）

### 影响
代码中直接写入加密密钥或 API 密钥，密钥一旦泄露即可被用于解密数据或伪造身份。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-798: Use of Hard-coded Credentials
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
将密钥迁移到密钥管理系统或环境变量，禁止提交到代码仓库，并轮换已暴露的密钥。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sample": <<<POS
YAKLANG_SF_POS_source-secrets-flutterwave-encryption-key
POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex(/(?:FLWSECK_TEST-(?i:[a-h0-9]{12}))|YAKLANG_SF_POS_source\-secrets\-flutterwave\-encryption\-key/) as $p0
$p0 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "low",
	title: "Flutterwave Encryption Key",
	title_zh: "检测到Flutterwave Encryption Key",
	message: "Flutterwave Encryption Key",
}
